# Agent-local state never belongs in the public repo (open-source gate):
# identity baselines, generated tool manifests, learning caches, review notes.
# This ignore is tree-only: git history still contains these files and older
# internal references. Never flip this repo public in place; rewrite its
# history first, or publish from a fresh-history copy instead.
